{
  "name": "Roland DJ-202",
  "author": "The OpenDJ contributors",
  "description": "Two-deck mapping for the Roland DJ-202. Control assignments were taken from Roland's MIDI implementation chart and cross checked against the Mixxx community mapping by Silvio Ankermann, Sebastian Reusse and Rene Kraus (https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx/wiki/Roland-Dj-202), which is GPLv2 or later and so compatible with this project. The browse encoder scrolls the library and the load buttons put the selected track on a deck. Deck-toggle, effects, the TR-S sequencer and the pad modes beyond hot cue are recognised by the hardware but not yet mapped here.",
